<Layout title="Digital Transformation Process Mining: Did Work Change? | RE-ViVE" description="Milestones and adoption dashboards do not confirm that work moved to the new path and left the old one. RE-ViVE shows it in how work actually executes." current="/initiative-digital-transformation">
